d":"c-shiji-126-huaji"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p022","text":"武帝時，徵北海太守詣行在所。有文學卒史王先生者，自請與太守俱，「吾有益於君」，君許之。諸府掾功曹白云：「王先生嗜酒，多言少實，恐不可與俱。」太守曰：「先生意欲行，不可逆。」遂與俱。行至宮下，待詔宮府門。王先生徒懷錢沽酒，與衛卒仆射飲，日醉，不視其太守。太守入跪拜。王先生謂戶郎曰：「幸為我呼吾君至門內遙語。」戶郎為呼太守。太守來，望見王先生。王先生曰：「天子即問君何以治北海令無盜賊，君對曰何哉？」對曰：「選擇賢材，各任之以其能，賞異等，罰不肖。」王先生曰：「對如是，是自譽自伐功，不可也。願君對言，非臣之力，盡陛下神靈威武所變化也。」太守曰：「諾。」召入，至于殿下，有詔問之曰：「何於治北海，令盜賊不起？」叩頭對言：「非臣之力，盡陛下神靈威武之所變化也。」武帝大笑，曰：「於呼！安得長者之語而稱之！安所受之？」對曰：「受之文學卒史。」帝曰：「今安在？」對曰：「在宮府門外。」有詔召拜王先生為水衡丞，以北海太守為水衡都尉。傳曰：「美言可以市，尊行可以加人。君子相送以言，小人相送以財。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"北海太守","kind":"person","person_id":"ltw_z5b_t1x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0015","start":15,"end":19,"surface":"文學卒史","kind":"person","person_id":"v0q_hjk_mfh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"王先生","kind":"person","person_id":"v0q_hjk_mfh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"太守","kind":"person","person_id":"ltw_z5b_t1x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0043","start":43,"end":48,"surface":"諸府掾功曹","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"王先生","kind":"person","person_id":"v0q_hjk_mfh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m022-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"太守","kind":"person","person_id":"ltw_z5b_t1x","status":"contextual_pro